{
  "id": "1SA.30",
  "number": "30",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Samwiri 30",
  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "30",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 30"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "30",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lweny gi Joamalek",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Daudi jotundo Ziklag i ndelo mar'adek, Joamalek oyido jomonjo yupiny ma piny Yuda gi Ziklag aka jowaŋo gi mac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jok'oneko nyatoro kad'acel, aka jomako ji je to jokadho gi jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Daudi gi cwo pere jotundo, jonwaŋo ni tindi pajo owaŋ aka mon pajo, gi nyithindho pajo je okadhi gi jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi gi cwo pere jotiŋo dwondi gin malo to jogoyo ndur, aka joywak cuka meni oloyo jo ma ywak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.25.42+1SA.25.43"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 25:42-43",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mon pa Daudi ario, Ahinowam ma wok Yezirel, gi Abigayili ciliendi Nabal ma wok Kamel je okadhi gi jo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi oyido nitie i teko rupiri cwo pere oyido jonitie gi gwayo i cuny jo aka oyido joluwo kwoŋ goyo Daudi gi telin ro nyithindho pajo. To Rwoth Were pere miyo go miseni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.22.20+1SA.22.21+1SA.22.22+1SA.22.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 22:20-23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi owaco ri wod pa Ahimelek, Abiatha jacway ri Were i wi migam kelo rigo law ma jocway ri Were i wi migam joruko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi openjo Rwoth ni, “K'anoluw Joamalek me anomaki jo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth odwoko go ni, “Luw jo ilamako jo to ibotho ji ma jomako je.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno to Daudi gi cwo pere 600 jokadho to jotundo milelo, aka jomegi jodoŋ kenyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi gi cwo pere 400 jomedere; aka cwo 200 oyido meni oloyo jo ma jok'onyalo kalo milelo to jodoŋ kenyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cwo pa Daudi jonwaŋo jacwo moro ma Jamisir i thim to jokelo go bongi Daudi; aka jomiyo go mugat gi pi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jomiyo go bende nyandere m'othwo, gi kayego ario ma nyingi vini m'othwo. Munyo jacwo no otieko camo, meni odwoko kwoŋe; rupiri go oyido ocowo ndelo adek ma k'ocemo kosa madho gimoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi openjo Jamisir no ni, “Ŋa ma jadwoŋ perin, aka iwok kune?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go odwoko ni, “An abedo Jamisir, aka abedo ŋeca pa Jaamalek. Jadwoŋ paran oweyan cen rupiri two omakan ndelo adek cen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyido wakwalo iy'adec pa Jokereth yupiny ma piny Yuda, gi iy'adec pa jonono pa Kaleb, aka wawaŋo Ziklag.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi openjo go ni, “Ilateran bongi Joamalek no?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jamisir odwoko Daudi ni, “K'ikwoŋere ran i nyingi Were ni ikilanekan, aka ikilamiyan i cingi jadwoŋ paran, alaterin bongi jo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo go otero Daudi bongi jo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joamalek oyido joywore kisi kamoro, jocemo, jomedho, aka jofore ro gigipiny kweth m'oyido jonyaga wok bongi Jofilistia gi piny Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawere odikin munyo nyaka piny cot, Daudi gi cwo pere jomonjo Joamalek, aka jolwenyo tundo othieno. Ongoye kada Jaamalek acel m'onyalo kwalok wok i cingi Daudi gi cwo pere, kwanyo woko yac 400 ama joidho kayina to jokwale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi obotho kisi ŋatimoro je m'oyido Joamalek jomako, kiri gi mon pere ario. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ongoye kada gimoro acel m'orwenyo. Daudi obotho nyithindho pa cwo pere je, kiri gi gigipiny ma Joamalek oyido jonyaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi bende omako ogwaŋe; aka cwo pere jocwayo dhok no yuwiy jo to jowaco ni, “Me je gigipiny pa Daudi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Daudi ogik bongi cwo pere 200 m'oyido meni oloyo jo ma kadho gi Daudi to jodoŋ milelo Besor. Jobino to jojolo Daudi gi cwo pere 400 aka Daudi ocore cegin bongi jo to m'otho jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To cwo pa Daudi man ma jogwondo aka bukony m'oyido jokadho gi go jowaco rigo ni, “Jono nende jok'okadho gi wan, riameno jok'olim gigipiny ma wadwoko gine. Jowokadhi gi mon kodi nyithindho pajo kende.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
