              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Daudi dwoko ni, “Wutmera, wikinyal timo ameno gi gima Rwoth omiyo wan; Rwoth ama ogwoko kwo mawan to miyo wan Joamalek i cingi wan ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
