          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiparo ni nitie ŋati manyalo yerok gi win i gime! Kisi nyatoro je, ŋati ma nende okidho i lweny gi ma nende odoŋ je; lalimo rapok marom.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.24"
            ]
          }
        }
