              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Daudi odwoko Ziklag, odhiro ri merin pere, jotel ma Yuda mic kwoŋ gigipiny ma jodwoko gine gi mikwenda ni, “Me mic perin wok kwoŋ gigipiny ma wanyaga kwoŋ jokwor pa Rwoth.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
